  "_comment_usage": [
    "── How to ground the whole fleet ───────────────────────────────────────",
    "  Set fleet_grounded to true and add a fleet_ground_reason.",
    "",
    "── How to ground a specific boat ───────────────────────────────────────",
    "  Add  \"grounded\": true  and optionally  \"reason\": \"...\"  to a craft entry.",
    "  Example:  \"LZ01\": { \"active\": true, \"grounded\": true, \"reason\": \"Broken mast\" }",
    "",
    "── How to permanently deactivate a boat ────────────────────────────────",
    "  Set  \"active\": false  (removes it from the selection screen entirely).",
    "",
    "── To restore a boat ───────────────────────────────────────────────────",
    "  Remove the grounded/reason fields, or set  \"grounded\": false."
  ],
